#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5142)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401PeekCaption"
msgid "401호 문 살짝 열리는 소리"
msgstr "401室的门开了条缝的声音"

#. Key:	HwangSpeaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5178)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5178)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,HwangSpeaker"
msgid "황순금"
msgstr "黄顺今"

#. Key:	Hwang401Peek
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5179)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5179)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Peek"
msgid "새벽에 나와 있었죠? 들어가서 눈 좀 붙여요."
msgstr "天没亮你就出来了吧？进屋眯一会儿。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Greeting
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5225)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5225)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Greeting"
msgid "403호 새로 온 아가씨죠? 밤엔 문 좀 살살 닫아 줘요. 여기 소리가 잘 울려서."
msgstr "你是新搬来403室的吧？晚上关门轻一点，这楼里声音传得远。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5241)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5241)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP5"
msgid "내일 아침에 또 벽을 막는대요. 물탱크 청소할 땐 배관 소리가 어찌나 큰지, 벽을 쳐도 안 들리던데."
msgstr "听说明天早上又要把墙封上。清洗水箱的那天凌晨，水管震得满墙都响，就算有人砸墙也没人知道。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5249)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5249)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP4"
msgid "벽이 하도 울길래 나도 똑같이 두드려 줬어요. 그랬더니 그날 밤은 조용하더라고요."
msgstr "墙一直响个不停，我也照着敲了回去。结果那天夜里就安静了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5257)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5257)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP3"
msgid "관리인 없어요? 열쇠는 늘 책상 위에 두던데. 못 들어가게 하면 나한테 말해요."
msgstr "管理员不在？钥匙他一直放在桌上。要是不让你进，就跟我说。"

#. Key:	Hwang401AfterT7
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5265)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5265)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401AfterT7"
msgid "그날도 들었어요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "那天我也听见了。都说那儿没人，可我明明听见了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5276)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5276)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP2"
msgid "몇 번을 전화했는데 맨날 배관 소리래요. 장부에 적기는 했나 좀 봐 줘요."
msgstr "因为那声音，我给管理室打了好几回电话，他就说是水管。你帮我看看他在台账上是怎么写的。"

#. Key:	Hwang401HintP1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5284)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5284)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401HintP1"
msgid "전기 나갔으면 1층 계량기함 봐요. 검침표도 거기 붙어 있어요."
msgstr "停电了就去看一楼的电表箱。抄表记录也贴在那儿。"

#. Key:	Hwang401Neutral
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5291)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5291)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401Neutral"
msgid "잠은 좀 잤어요? 물이라도 한 잔 마시고 가요."
msgstr "睡了一会儿没有？好歹喝杯水再走。"

#. Key:	Arrival401PrayerStops
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5344)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5344)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Arrival401PrayerStops"
msgid "안에서 들리던 불경 소리가 멈춘다"
msgstr "里面的念经声停了"

#. Key:	Hwang401JournalGiven
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5429)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5429)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401JournalGiven"
msgid "문고리에 걸어 둔 거 읽어 봐요. 사람이 없다는데, 난 분명히 들었다니까요."
msgstr "我挂在门把手上的东西，你看看。都说那儿没人，可我明明听见了。"

#. Key:	Hwang401SonDay
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5445)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5445)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401SonDay"
msgid "이삿짐 들어오던 날, 그날이 손 있는 날이었어요."
msgstr "你搬进来那天，正是游魂出没的日子。"

#. Key:	Hwang401DontOpen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5452)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5452)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401DontOpen"
msgid "문 두드린다고 다 열어 주는 거 아니에요."
msgstr "不是谁敲门都要开的。"

#. Key:	Hwang401DarkWarning
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5471)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5471)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Hwang401DarkWarning"
msgid "새벽에 깜깜한 데서 뭐가 보이거든 쳐다보지 말아요."
msgstr "凌晨要是在黑地方看见什么，别盯着看。"

#. Key:	YudamToHwangAnswer
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5515)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5515)
