msgstr "墙里有回应了。两下，停一下，再一下。是我哥敲门的节奏。"

#. Key:	Hwang401IsItYourBrother
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5525)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(5525)
