msgstr "警方已调取两本投诉台账及两天的建材收据"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(954)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(954)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4Seen"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 “그 뒤로 새벽마다 깼다”며 출석 의사를 밝혔다"
msgstr "前租客徐某称“那之后每天凌晨都会醒”，表示愿意到案说明情况"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(961)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(961)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews4"
msgid "전 세입자 서모씨는 변호인을 통해 출석 의사를 밝혔다"
msgstr "前租客徐某通过律师表示愿意到案说明情况"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Recorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(972)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(972)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Recorder"
