msgstr "该楼的监控录像机被发现时，存储硬盘已被拆走"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews6Calendar
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(981)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(981)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews6Calendar"
msgid "관리실 벽 달력은 지난해 7월 26일에 표시된 채 멈춰 있었다"
msgstr "管理室墙上的挂历停在去年7月，26日那天画着记号"

#. Key:	EpilogueNews5Roster
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(993)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(993)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews5Roster"
msgid "인근 편의점 직원은 사건 당일 야간 근무 중 들은 소리를 진술했다"
msgstr "附近便利店店员陈述了案发当天值夜班时听到的声音"

#. Key:	FifthDawnCaptionStart
