msgstr "抽水泵停了。等故障灯灭了再说。"

#. Key:	P5MaskReady
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2496)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2496)
