msgstr "录下来了。这次没问题。"

#. Key:	NightFourStrikeFirst
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2689)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(2689)
