#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3023)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyGlove"
msgid "5층 장갑에 석고가 굳어 있던데요. 아저씨 거예요?"
msgstr "五楼有一只手套。我哥戴的话，大了两个号。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyRecorder
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3030)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3030)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyRecorder"
msgid "녹화기 하드는 언제 빼셨어요?"
msgstr "录像机的硬盘，您是什么时候拆的？"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyInnerRoom
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3037)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3037)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyInnerRoom"
msgid "안쪽 방에 뭘 계속 돌려 놓으셨던데요. 그래서 못 들으셨어요?"
msgstr "您在里屋一直开着什么东西。所以才没听见吗？"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyWind
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3044)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3044)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyWind"
msgid "옥상에서 바람 들어 봤어요. 바람이 둘, 쉬고, 하나로 불어요?"
msgstr "我在天台听过风声。风会吹出两下，停一下，再一下吗？"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyPack
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3055)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3055)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyPack"
msgid "탱크 옆에 꽁초 여섯 개요. 거기 앉아서 쉬던 사람이 있었다고요."
msgstr "水箱边上有六个烟头。有人在那儿坐着歇过脚。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyBowl
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3062)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3062)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyBowl"
msgid "401호 할머니는 아직도 물그릇을 갈아 놓으세요. 매일요."
msgstr "401室的奶奶到现在还在给水碗换水。天天都换。"

#. Key:	ConfrontationReplyPills
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3069)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3069)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ConfrontationReplyPills"
msgid "서일영 씨 아세요? 골목에 그분 약봉투가 떨어져 있던데요."
msgstr "巷子里掉的那个药袋上，写着徐一英的名字。"

#. Key:	EndingBRecordingOffCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3224)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3224)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBRecordingOffCaption"
msgid "폰 녹음 끄는 소리"
msgstr "关掉手机录音的声音"

#. Key:	EndingAChoiceThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3232)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3232)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingAChoiceThought"
msgid "여기 내려놓자. 밖에 나가서 사람을 불러야 해."
msgstr "放在这儿吧。得出去叫人来。"

#. Key:	EndingBChoiceThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3236)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3236)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBChoiceThought"
msgid "조금만 더 여기 있을게."
msgstr "我在这儿再待一会儿。"

#. Key:	EndingBAnswerCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3422)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3422)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBAnswerCaption"
msgid "복도 끝에서 대답하듯 두 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "走廊尽头传来两下敲击声，像在回应"

#. Key:	EndingBRingbackCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3504)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3504)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBRingbackCaption"
msgid "112 연결음"
msgstr "呼叫112的等待音"

#. Key:	EndingCCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3670)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(3670)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingCCaption"
msgid "아주 가까이서, 똑같이 두 번 두드리는 소리"
msgstr "很近的地方，一模一样的两下敲击声"

#. Key:	EvictionNoticePrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(430)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(430)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionNoticePrompt"
msgid "퇴거 통보문 읽기"
msgstr "看退租通知"

#. Key:	EvictionNoticeThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(434)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(434)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EvictionNoticeThought"
msgid "이번 주 안에 나가라고? 내가 밤에 올라간 걸 아는 거야."
msgstr "说我擅自操作设施，让我这周之内搬走。他知道我晚上上去过。"

#. Key:	CleaningDrainPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(449)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(449)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,CleaningDrainPrompt"
msgid "세척 배수 밸브 열기"
msgstr "打开排水阀"

#. Key:	FloatBypassPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(462)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(462)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,FloatBypassPrompt"
msgid "우회 밸브 열기"
msgstr "打开旁通阀"

#. Key:	TransferPumpPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(481)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(481)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TransferPumpPrompt"
msgid "이송 펌프 수동으로 돌리기"
msgstr "手动启动抽水泵"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheetPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(505)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(505)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheetPrompt"
msgid "저수조 점검 메모"
msgstr "水箱检修备忘"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheetTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(507)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(507)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheetTitle"
msgid "저수조 점검 메모 (2019.03)"
msgstr "水箱检修备忘（2019.03）"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(509)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(509)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet1"
msgid "물이 넘친 날: 배수는 잠겨 있었고, 우회만 열려 있었음."
msgstr "溢水那天：排水阀关着，只开了旁通阀。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(510)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(510)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet2"
msgid "펌프가 멎은 날: 배수만 열고 돌림. 우회관에 물이 안 찼음."
msgstr "泵停那天：只开了排水阀就启动。旁通管里没进水。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(511)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(511)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet3"
msgid "세척할 때는 자동 수위 조절을 쓰지 말 것."
msgstr "清洗时不要用自动水位调节。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(513)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(513)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet4"
msgid "고장등이 켜지면 손대지 말고 10초 정도 기다리세요."
msgstr "故障灯亮时别动，等10秒左右。"

#. Key:	ProcedureSheet5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(514)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(514)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ProcedureSheet5"
msgid "배관이 조용해지고 등이 꺼진 뒤 다시 돌리면 됩니다."
msgstr "等管道安静下来、灯灭了，再启动就行。"

#. Key:	WallBreakPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(564)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(564)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,WallBreakPrompt"
msgid "벽을 망치로 두드리기"
msgstr "用锤子砸墙"

#. Key:	EndingAPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(582)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(582)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingAPrompt"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 오빠 곁에 두고 물러나기"
msgstr "把调音扳手放在哥身边，退后"

#. Key:	EndingBPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(596)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightFourDirector.cpp(596)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EndingBPrompt"
msgid "녹음 끄고 곁에 앉아 대답하기"
msgstr "关掉录音，坐到他身边回应"

#. Key:	KeyringPaperThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1292)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1292)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KeyringPaperThought"
msgid "열쇠 옆에 부동산 문자 뽑아 둔 게 있네."
msgstr "钥匙旁边有张打印出来的中介短信。"

#. Key:	ValveOpenPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1313)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1313)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ValveOpenPrompt"
msgid "열린 배관 밸브"
msgstr "已打开的管道阀门"

#. Key:	ValveThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1362)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1362)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ValveThought"
msgid "물 내려가는 소리가 난다. 이제 벽에 귀를 대 보자."
msgstr "有水往下流的声音了。现在贴着墙听听看。"

#. Key:	TuningHammerArrivalEcho
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1472)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1472)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TuningHammerArrivalEcho"
msgid "이사 온 날 옥상 문 너머에서 들린 그 소리다."
msgstr "就是搬来那天，在天台门那边听到的声音。"

#. Key:	TuningHammerListingThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1488)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1488)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TuningHammerListingThought"
msgid "목록에 있던 공구다. 이것까지 팔지는 못했네."
msgstr "是二手信息里列过的工具。这件到底没卖出去。"

#. Key:	TunerCartThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1525)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1525)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TunerCartThought"
msgid "바퀴 하나가 깨졌네. 천장에서 들리던 소리랑 비슷하다."
msgstr "有个轮子坏了。声音和天花板上传来的有点像。"

#. Key:	AnnexRecognitionThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1630)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1630)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,AnnexRecognitionThought"
msgid "CCTV에서 본 곳이다. 저 전구, 왼쪽으로 꺾이는 복도."
msgstr "是监控里看到的那条走廊。一个灯泡，往左拐的路。"

#. Key:	PlasterDatingThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1652)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1652)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,PlasterDatingThought"
msgid "안쪽은 바싹 말랐는데, 바깥 실리콘은 덜 굳었어. 얼마 전에 또 막았나?"
msgstr "里层的石膏板已经干透了，外面的密封胶还没完全凝固。最近又封过一次？"

#. Key:	TankAuditionCaption
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1701)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1701)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TankAuditionCaption"
msgid "[안쪽] 물이 아주 천천히 흐르는 소리"
msgstr "［里面］非常缓慢的流水声"

#. Key:	TankAuditionThoughtCrossed
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1716)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1716)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TankAuditionThoughtCrossed"
msgid "탱크에 물이 가득 찼다. 벽 바로 뒤로 배관이 지나가네."
msgstr "水箱里的水是满的。墙后面紧挨着就有管子经过。"

#. Key:	TankAuditionThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1720)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1720)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,TankAuditionThought"
msgid "이 밑으로 급수관이 내려가네."
msgstr "供水管从这下面往下走。"

#. Key:	ListenSilent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1741)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1741)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenSilent"
msgid "조용하네. 세 벽 다 똑같아."
msgstr "很安静。三面墙都一样。"

#. Key:	ListenSilentAgain
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1746)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1746)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenSilentAgain"
msgid "조용하네. 여기도 똑같아."
msgstr "很安静。这里也一样。"

#. Key:	ListenSilentFirst
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1750)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1750)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenSilentFirst"
msgid "조용하네."
msgstr "很安静。"

#. Key:	ListenCavityFirst
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1773)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1773)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenCavityFirst"
msgid "바로 뒤로 물이 흐른다. 소리가 길게 울리네."
msgstr "水就在墙后面流。声音拖得很长。"

#. Key:	ListenCavity
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1778)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1778)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenCavity"
msgid "바로 뒤로 물이 흐른다. 이 벽만 속이 빈 것 같아."
msgstr "水就在墙后面流。好像只有这面墙是空的。"

#. Key:	ListenCavityUnread
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1782)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1782)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenCavityUnread"
msgid "바로 뒤로 물이 흐른다. 이 벽만 소리가 달라. 왜 이러지?"
msgstr "水就在墙后面流。只有这面墙声音不一样。怎么回事？"

#. Key:	ListenFar
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1796)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1796)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenFar"
msgid "물소리가 멀리서 웅웅거리네."
msgstr "水声在远处嗡嗡地响。"

#. Key:	ListenFarCompared
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1801)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1801)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenFarCompared"
msgid "여기선 물소리가 멀어. 아까 그 벽만 속이 비어 있었어."
msgstr "这里水声离得远。刚才只有那面墙是空的。"

#. Key:	ListenFarComparedUnread
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1805)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1805)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,ListenFarComparedUnread"
msgid "여기선 물소리가 멀어. 아까 그 벽만 소리가 길게 울렸는데."
msgstr "这里水声离得远。刚才只有那面墙声音拖得很长。"

#. Key:	KnockCavityFirst
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1869)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1869)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KnockCavityFirst"
msgid "소리가 오래 울리네."
msgstr "声音拖得很长。"

#. Key:	KnockCavity
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1874)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1874)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KnockCavity"
msgid "소리가 오래 울린다. 안이 비어 있어."
msgstr "声音拖得很长。里面是空的。"

#. Key:	KnockCavityUnread
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1878)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1878)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KnockCavityUnread"
msgid "소리가 오래 울린다. 이 벽만 달라. 오빠였으면 왜 그런지 알았을 텐데."
msgstr "声音拖得很长。只有这面墙不一样。换作是哥，肯定知道为什么。"

#. Key:	KnockSolid
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1889)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1889)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KnockSolid"
msgid "소리가 금방 끊긴다."
msgstr "声音一下就断了。"

#. Key:	KnockSolidCompared
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1894)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1894)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KnockSolidCompared"
msgid "소리가 금방 끊기네. 아까 그 벽만 속이 비어 있었어."
msgstr "声音一下就断了。刚才只有那面墙是空的。"

#. Key:	KnockSolidComparedUnread
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1898)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(1898)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,KnockSolidComparedUnread"
msgid "소리가 금방 끊기네. 아까 그 벽만 길게 울렸는데."
msgstr "声音一下就断了。刚才只有那面墙声音拖得很长。"

#. Key:	AnswerThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(2224)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(2224)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,AnswerThought"
msgid "…대답했어."
msgstr "……回应了。"

#. Key:	NotebookRhythmRecognized
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(2262)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(2262)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,NotebookRhythmRecognized"
msgid "아빠가 문 두드리던 박자잖아. 오빠가 내 방문에 하던 거."
msgstr "是爸爸的敲门声。哥以前就是这样敲我房门的。"

#. Key:	LabelsAddressThought
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(2306)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(2306)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,LabelsAddressThought"
