#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(949)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JournalPrompt"
msgid "달력 뒷장 소리 일지"
msgstr "挂历背面的声音记录"

#. Key:	JournalTitle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(951)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(951)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JournalTitle"
msgid "401호 황순금 소리 일지"
msgstr "401室 黄顺今 声音记录"

#. Key:	Journal1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(953)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(953)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal1"
msgid "7/27  네 시 반쯤 또 깸. 위에서 다섯 번. 관리실 전화 안 받음."
msgstr "7/27  四点半左右又醒了。楼上五下。管理室没人接电话。"

#. Key:	Journal2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(954)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(954)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal2"
msgid "7/28  또 다섯 번. 어제보다 힘이 없음."
msgstr "7/28  又是五下。比昨天没力气。"

#. Key:	Journal3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(955)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(955)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal3"
msgid "7/29  벽이 하도 울어서 나도 두드려 줬다. 저쪽이 하던 대로 둘, 쉬고, 하나. 그랬더니 조용하데. 사람인가."
msgstr "7/29  墙响得太厉害，我也敲了回去。照那边的敲法，两下，停一下，再一下。这么一敲，就安静了。是人吗？"

#. Key:	Journal4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(956)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(956)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal4"
msgid "7/30  네 번 들음. 수도 틀자 안 들림."
msgstr "7/30  听到四下。一开水龙头就听不见了。"

#. Key:	Journal5
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(957)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(957)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Journal5"
msgid "7/31  오늘은 세 번. 귀가 먹은 건지."
msgstr "7/31  今天三下。是我耳朵背了？"

#. Key:	Journal6
