msgid "텅 비었네. 물이라도 좀 사다 놔야겠다."
msgstr "空空的。至少得买点水回来。"

#. Key:	HideExitPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGHidingSpot.cpp(102)
#: Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGHidingSpot.cpp(102)
