msgid "읽기"
msgstr "阅读"

#. Key:	Reply
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGResonantPanel.cpp(109)
#: Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGResonantPanel.cpp(109)
msgctxt "IGPanel,Reply"
msgid "손을 떼고 한참 있다가 튀어나오네."
msgstr "松手过了好一会儿才弹回来。"

#. Key:	Press
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGResonantPanel.cpp(38)
#: Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGResonantPanel.cpp(38)
msgctxt "IGPanel,Press"
msgid "들뜬 벽판 눌러 보기"
msgstr "按一下松动的墙板"

#. Key:	Loose
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGResonantPanel.cpp(70)
#: Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGResonantPanel.cpp(70)
msgctxt "IGPanel,Loose"
msgid "여기만 덧댔네. 손으로 누르면 들어간다."
msgstr "只有这块是补上去的。用手一按就陷进去。"

#. Key:	Rattle
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGResonantPanel.cpp(99)
#: Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGResonantPanel.cpp(99)
msgctxt "IGPanel,Rattle"
