msgstr "墙板咔嗒弹回的声音"

#. Key:	On
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGRoomLightSwitch.cpp(23)
#: Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGRoomLightSwitch.cpp(23)
