msgstr "打开房间的灯"

#. Key:	Off
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGRoomLightSwitch.cpp(24)
#: Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGRoomLightSwitch.cpp(24)
