msgstr "关掉房间的灯"

#. Key:	OpenPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGSwingDoor.cpp(44)
#: Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGSwingDoor.cpp(44)
