msgid "문 열기"
msgstr "开门"

#. Key:	ClosePrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGSwingDoor.cpp(45)
#: Source/IndieGame/Interaction/IGSwingDoor.cpp(45)
